WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:02.200
Welcome to the arena.

00:02.200 --> 00:04.440
This isn't just a platform,

00:04.440 --> 00:08.240
it's your starting line for a new kind of leadership,

00:08.240 --> 00:11.480
built from within, conditioned to win.

00:11.480 --> 00:14.160
Here, you're not just joining a course,

00:14.160 --> 00:18.960
you're stepping into a system, a movement, a mindset.

00:18.960 --> 00:22.660
Inside this space, you'll find the M.V.P. Accelerator.

00:23.580 --> 00:25.520
Our foundational experience,

00:25.520 --> 00:28.080
alongside other high-impact programs,

00:28.080 --> 00:30.000
will continue to release.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.440
But first, let's talk about who you are here.

00:34.440 --> 00:36.880
You're not here because of a title.

00:36.880 --> 00:40.120
You're not here because of a position.

00:40.120 --> 00:43.520
You're here because you believe there's more,

00:43.520 --> 00:46.840
and you're willing to do the work to unlock it.

00:46.840 --> 00:49.080
You're not simply a participant.

00:49.080 --> 00:51.480
We call you an Athleader.

00:51.480 --> 00:55.160
An Athleader is someone who leads like the elite perform,

00:55.160 --> 00:57.360
resilient under pressure,

00:57.400 --> 01:02.000
clear in purpose, built for the long game.

01:02.000 --> 01:05.220
And for those of you who are managers in your role,

01:05.220 --> 01:08.600
you're not just a bystander supporting your participant.

01:08.600 --> 01:12.560
You're a Player-Coach, responsible for leading yourself

01:12.560 --> 01:15.480
and influencing those around you.

01:15.480 --> 01:18.820
This is your locker room moment.

01:18.820 --> 01:23.340
Well, you're prepared, reflect, and commit.

01:23.340 --> 01:25.320
Because leadership isn't a position,

01:25.360 --> 01:28.320
it's a daily practice.

01:28.320 --> 01:31.080
Why is the lion a symbol for leadership?

01:31.080 --> 01:34.040
Not because it's the biggest or the strongest,

01:34.040 --> 01:36.440
but because of its mindset.

01:36.440 --> 01:41.240
That's what we're building here, mental muscle memory.

01:41.240 --> 01:43.560
We condition across A.R.A.W.

01:43.560 --> 01:45.480
It's what we call the Core 4.

01:45.480 --> 01:49.720
It's agility, resilience, alignment, and wellbeing,

01:49.720 --> 01:53.220
grounded in neuroscience and performance psychology

01:53.220 --> 01:57.300
to shape identity that endures under pressure.

01:57.300 --> 02:00.620
You will track your momentum, know your metrics.

02:00.620 --> 02:02.940
You'll see how far you've come

02:02.940 --> 02:05.140
and where you can still grow.

02:05.140 --> 02:08.220
Know this, you're not alone.

02:08.220 --> 02:09.820
You're a part of a team.

02:09.820 --> 02:11.860
You'll be connected to your squad,

02:11.860 --> 02:15.780
extended M.V.P. community, and accountability partner.

02:15.780 --> 02:18.540
You will learn from other Athleader pros,

02:18.540 --> 02:22.180
share your voice, and celebrate progress together.

02:22.180 --> 02:23.540
So what's next?

02:23.540 --> 02:26.980
Go through your step-by-step actions to get started.

02:26.980 --> 02:30.480
Lace up, lock in, let's go.

02:30.480 --> 02:32.440
This is your arena.

02:32.440 --> 02:34.400
This is your time.

02:34.400 --> 02:36.340
Let's win from within.

